SOAPBOX: Really enjoyed this one. Decided to do 24 hour Classic and spread my time over two days.instead of trying to stay in the chair until I had leg cramps! Getting up alot and walking around, and staying hydrated helped. Station worked great and I felt loud. Filters in the 7610 let me squeeze in and run where I never would be able to were it not for the excellent filters. Even got the band edge a couple times...hope KQ2M is OK!
